# Firebase (m4tr!x)

Firebase-first. Before implementing auth, data model, offline sync, or Functions:

1. Propose options (Auth providers, Firestore vs alternatives, offline local DB, security rules shape).
2. Wait for captain approval.
3. Document decisions in `docs/sdlc/DESIGN.md`.

## Always

- Security rules are part of the feature — not an afterthought
- No secrets in client source; use proper config / env patterns
- Offline/multi-user sync: call out conflict strategy explicitly
- Prefer Cloud Functions only when client-only is insufficient
